              <i data-lucide="lock-keyhole" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
              No credentials or authentication tokens are stored in browser storage.
            </p>
            <button type="submit" id="saveSettings" class="btn btn-primary">
              <i data-lucide="save" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
              Save Settings
            </button>
